--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4ff683893bac9746af2ea0c678c1c78, type: 3}
  m_Name: BossFiring
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  dialogues:
  - characterName: CEO Lisa
    characterArt: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fdbc2aae618edb045be518aaa8582daa, type: 3}
    speech:
    - 'Thanks for coming. '
    - "Listen, there\u2019s no easy way of saying this\u2026 "
    - "And you\u2019ve served this company well over the last several years\u2026 "
    - 'But as of today, your services are no longer needed here. '
    - "I know this might come as a shock. Please don\u2019t take it personally. We
      have simply decided to redirect our vision.  "
    - 'Please clean out your desk and say your goodbyes, but make it quick. '
  - characterName: HR Meghan
    characterArt: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f44577708d38d0840bbaa538ca1642ca, type: 3}
    speech:
    - "You\u2019re required to return your issued laptop to IT, and stop by my office
      to pick up your severance package. "
  - characterName: CEO Lisa
    characterArt: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fdbc2aae618edb045be518aaa8582daa, type: 3}
    speech:
    - "These tasks shouldn\u2019t take you too long\u2014keep an eye on the clock,
      or we might need to send security after you\u2026 "
  - characterName: HR Meghan
    characterArt: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f44577708d38d0840bbaa538ca1642ca, type: 3}
    speech:
    - "If you\u2019re still around in 10 minutes, they will promptly escort you downstairs. "
  - characterName: CEO Lisa
    characterArt: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fdbc2aae618edb045be518aaa8582daa, type: 3}
    speech:
    - Thanks for your hard work and dedication to the company. We wish you the best
      in whatever professional endeavors you achieve next.
  - characterName: (In Your Head)
    characterArt: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 794dd41368b2b7f4bb1928c2475f7e63, type: 3}
    speech:
    - "Aw, man\u2026 Fired?!"
    - What am I gonna do now?
    - "Guess I\u2019d better get going\u2026"
